format 1

# actlith's own registry: the workflows this repository's CI runs,
# rendered by `actlith gen`. The gate kind runs the hk gate on every
# CI system with the pr0d1r2 cache (nix T31, V21). 90 minutes, not 30:
# the cache has no x86_64-darwin builds yet, so the first macos-15-intel
# run builds hk, pklith and the fleet tools from source (nix C).

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|-|pr0d1r2|timeout=90
